# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Tunables with the groups and the dual list (D245, #270): an
# update and `gradient()` against the neighbor matrix, and the frame
# evaluator over frames far from each other and in another cell, each of
# which begins an activation whose lists are built for it.
# Inputs/python_groups.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t tunables Double | FileCheck %s -DP=Double
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t tunables Mixed | FileCheck %s -DP=Mixed
# CHECK: [[P]]: an update of the tunables and gradient() with the groups
# CHECK: [[P]]: the frame evaluator with the groups over frames far apart and in another cell
# CHECK: tunables [[P]] passed
